# Real bin/fm-bootstrap.sh from the gate worktree, lab home $LAB, on macOS with a uname stand-in that reports Linux for 'uname -s' only
# (no Linux VM was available). tailscale is a stand-in reporting 'stopped' (exit 1) unless the case says it is up; the host's own
# Tailscale is up, which on its own silences the advice as designed. TOOLCHAIN_DRIFT lines from the host toolchain filtered.

